WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:05.843
&gt;&gt; Laura: AND SANCTUARY

00:00:05.276 --> 00:00:06.477
POLITICIANS VERSUS THE RULE OF

00:00:05.977 --> 00:00:09.647
LAW, THAT IS THE FOCUS OF

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:14.952
TONIGHT'S "ANGLE" ."

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:15.586
WHEN IMMIGRATION CUTS WERE

00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:20.324
ENFORCED THAT IT HAD JUST

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:21.726
WRAPPED A THREE-DAY SWEEP THAT

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:24.462
NETTED 150 ILLEGAL ALIENS,

00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:26.330
MANY OF YOU WERE PROBABLY, BUT

00:00:24.595 --> 00:00:26.731
OAKLAND MAYOR LIBBY SCHAAF WAS

00:00:26.464 --> 00:00:30.067
NOT AMUSED.

00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:31.135
LAST WEEKEND, MAYOR SCHAAF TOOK

00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:32.103
THE EXTRAORDINARY STEP OF

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:34.705
SENDING OUT A PUBLIC NOTICE THAT

00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:39.310
WARNED IMMIGRANTS AND THEIR

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:39.744
FAMILIES OF THE IMPENDING I.C.E.

00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:41.345
RAIDS.

00:00:39.877 --> 00:00:43.147
&gt;&gt; I CONTINUE TO FEEL CONFIDENT

00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:45.549
THAT WHAT I DID WAS THE RIGHT

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:47.518
THING AND IT WAS LEGAL.

00:00:45.683 --> 00:00:48.185
I DID NOT GIVE SPECIFIC

00:00:47.651 --> 00:00:51.555
INFORMATION THAT COULD HAVE

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:53.924
ENDANGERED LAW ENFORCEMENT.

00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:56.927
I ENCOURAGED PEOPLE TO NOT PANIC

00:00:54.058 --> 00:00:58.162
BUT TO KNOW THEIR RIGHTS, TO

00:00:57.061 --> 00:00:59.630
KNOW THEIR RESPONSIBILITIES, AND

00:00:58.295 --> 00:01:00.398
TO KNOW ABOUT THE UNIQUE

00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:02.767
RESOURCES THAT ARE AVAILABLE IN

00:01:00.531 --> 00:01:05.269
THIS COMMUNITY.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:07.138
&gt;&gt; Laura: NOW, ACCORDING TO

00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:09.040
THAT WARPED VIEW, IMMIGRATION

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:13.744
LAWS ARE, AT THEIR CORE,

00:01:09.173 --> 00:01:14.745
DISCRIMINATORY AND UNFAIR, AND

00:01:13.878 --> 00:01:16.614
THEREFORE, IGNORING THEM OR

00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:19.116
AVOIDING THEM IS NOT ONLY FINE,

00:01:16.747 --> 00:01:21.152
IT IS THE HONORABLE THING TO DO.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.153
SO GET THIS, IF YOU ARE A

00:01:21.285 --> 00:01:23.587
CRIMINAL ALIEN, THERE IS NO

00:01:22.286 --> 00:01:27.525
BETTER STATE TO LIVE IN THEN

00:01:23.721 --> 00:01:30.227
GOOD OLD CALIFORNIA.

00:01:27.658 --> 00:01:31.529
WHAT MAYOR SCHAAF DID WITH HER

00:01:30.361 --> 00:01:32.630
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANT EMERGENCY

00:01:31.662 --> 00:01:34.498
BROADCAST BULLETIN, IT WASN'T

00:01:32.763 --> 00:01:39.103
JUST OUTRAGEOUS, IT IS

00:01:34.632 --> 00:01:40.404
POTENTIALLY CRIMINAL.

00:01:39.236 --> 00:01:41.038
I.C.E. DIRECTOR TOM HOMAN SAID

00:01:40.538 --> 00:01:43.707
THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS

00:01:41.172 --> 00:01:46.110
REVIEWING THE POSSIBILITY OF

00:01:43.841 --> 00:01:48.946
FILING FEDERAL CHARGES AGAINST

00:01:46.243 --> 00:01:50.714
THE MAYOR, AND THE WASHINGTON

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.250
TIMES HEADLINE SAID, "LOCKED

00:01:50.848 --> 00:01:54.318
LIBBY UP NOW, WORRY ABOUT

00:01:53.384 --> 00:01:55.286
HILLARY LATER."

00:01:54.452 --> 00:01:59.156
THAT WAS A FUN ONE.

00:01:55.419 --> 00:02:00.057
HALF OF THE 150 ARRESTED WERE

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.527
CONVICTED CRIMINALS, AND THE

00:02:00.191 --> 00:02:07.698
CHARGES INCLUDE GANG MEMBERSHIP,

00:02:03.661 --> 00:02:07.998
WEAPONS, DOMESTIC VIOLENCE, AND

00:02:07.832 --> 00:02:11.936
DUIS.

00:02:08.132 --> 00:02:13.537
BUT UNFORTUNATELY, SOME 864

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:15.473
CRIMINALS THAT I.C.E. WAS

00:02:13.671 --> 00:02:16.807
SEEKING REMAIN AT LARGE IN THE

00:02:15.606 --> 00:02:18.776
OAKLAND AND SAN FRANCISCO

00:02:16.941 --> 00:02:19.877
REGIONS.

00:02:18.909 --> 00:02:23.681
NOW, SOME OF THEM UNDOUBTEDLY

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:29.120
FLED THE AREA AFTER RECEIVING

00:02:23.814 --> 00:02:31.255
THE WARNING BY MAYOR SCHAAF.

00:02:29.253 --> 00:02:33.724
WELL, THIS INCENSED THE I.C.E.

00:02:31.388 --> 00:02:34.425
DIRECTOR, TOM HOMAN, WHO SPOKE

00:02:33.858 --> 00:02:35.392
WITH "FOX &amp; FRIENDS."

00:02:34.558 --> 00:02:36.760
&gt;&gt; AND POLITICIANS CHOOSE TO

00:02:35.526 --> 00:02:38.529
TAKE CARE OF THEIR POLITICAL

00:02:36.894 --> 00:02:39.930
AMBITIONS AND MAKE POLITICAL

00:02:38.662 --> 00:02:40.965
STATEMENTS ON THE BACKS OF LAW

00:02:40.064 --> 00:02:43.701
ENFORCEMENT, IT'S TERRIBLE.

00:02:41.098 --> 00:02:45.503
IT MAKES OUR JOB MORE DIFFICULT.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:46.670
I WILL SAY THIS, A MAYOR AND

00:02:45.636 --> 00:02:48.539
EVERY OTHER POLITICIAN THAT

00:02:46.804 --> 00:02:49.006
WANTS TO VILIFY I.C.E., WE ARE

00:02:48.672 --> 00:02:50.908
NOT GOING WAY.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.408
WE ARE GOING TO KEEP ENFORCING

00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:53.611
THE LAW.

00:02:51.542 --> 00:02:56.280
&gt;&gt; Laura: OF COURSE, THE MAYOR

00:02:53.744 --> 00:02:59.116
DEFENDED HER ACTIONS, CALLING IT

00:02:56.413 --> 00:03:00.117
HER DUTY AND MORAL OBLIGATION.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.319
OH, PLEASE.

00:03:00.251 --> 00:03:03.521
AND SHE LATER TOLD

00:03:02.453 --> 00:03:05.556
"THE WASHINGTON POST," "I

00:03:03.654 --> 00:03:05.890
CONSIDER MYSELF A LAW-ABIDING

00:03:05.689 --> 00:03:08.359
CITIZEN.

00:03:06.023 --> 00:03:09.660
I CONSIDER MYSELF A BELIEVER IN

00:03:08.492 --> 00:03:13.397
AMERICAN DEMOCRACY THAT MOVES

00:03:09.793 --> 00:03:15.132
TOWARDS A MORE JUST SOCIETY, AND

00:03:13.531 --> 00:03:15.733
I DEFINITELY CONSIDER MYSELF

00:03:15.266 --> 00:03:18.936
PART OF THE RESISTANCE.

00:03:15.866 --> 00:03:19.737
AT LEAST SHE'S HONEST.

00:03:19.069 --> 00:03:20.471
RESISTANCE TO COMMON SENSE, IT

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:25.109
MAY BE.

00:03:20.604 --> 00:03:27.344
WELL DOING THIS, MAYOR SCHAAF'S

00:03:25.242 --> 00:03:29.880
DANCING RIGHT ON THE EDGE OF

00:03:27.478 --> 00:03:31.282
OBSTRUCTION OF JUSTICE FOR

00:03:30.014 --> 00:03:32.149
SHAMELESSLY PUTTING AGENTS,

00:03:31.415 --> 00:03:34.118
POLICE, AND HER NEIGHBORS IN

00:03:32.283 --> 00:03:35.953
NATE MY DANGER.

00:03:34.251 --> 00:03:37.121
I REALLY HOPE THAT

00:03:36.086 --> 00:03:38.322
ATTORNEY GENERAL JEFF SESSIONS

00:03:37.254 --> 00:03:38.622
IS TAKING A SERIOUS LOOK AT

00:03:38.455 --> 00:03:42.026
THIS.

00:03:38.756 --> 00:03:44.762
HERE'S THE BOTTOM LINE.

00:03:42.159 --> 00:03:46.764
BECAUSE THE OAKLAND MAYOR PUT

00:03:44.895 --> 00:03:47.498
POLITICS AND, FRANKLY, HER SHEER

